SUMMARY:End of School Party
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the end of the school year with an evening of music\, treats\, shopping\, and family friendly fun at Soma Sweets\, located at 58 Vose Ave in South Orange\, NJ\, on Thursday\, June 18 from 5 to 8PM. \nEnjoy free live music from Sasso\, Pinky\, and The Brand New Steadys while spending time with friends and kicking off summer. Food and treats from Soma Sweets and Giorgio’s Ristorante will be available for purchase throughout the evening. \nGuests can also shop and explore activities from The Botanica Boutique\, The Charmery\, and Keepsake Studios\, along with fairy hair and unicorn braiding from Enchantresses. For more information\, please visit: https://www.southorangedowntown.org/ \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
