SUMMARY:Father's Day Breakfast & Awards Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 19th Annual Father’s Day Breakfast Celebration June 20\, 2026\, from 8:00 am sharp to 11:30 am at the Montclair High School\, 9th Grade Academy Building Atrium\, North Fullerton Entrance. This special event honors fathers and community leaders with a morning filled with inspiring speeches\, delicious food\, and heartfelt acknowledgments. \nOur Guest Speakers this year will be Michael Spence\, Speaker | Mentor | Visionary Leader; Maurice Brown\, Fashion Industry Executive\, Ralph Lauren and Brian Lockhart\, Storyteller and Media Executive\, ESPN. \nTickets can be purchased online by clicking the button below or the QR Code. Ticket prices are: Adults $35 ($40 at the door)\, Seniors $25 and Students with ID $15 and children under 5 are free. Questions can be directed to Joe Davis on 201 306-1518. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
